    "description": "Precision oceanographic instrument manufacturer based in Bergen, Norway, producing CTD sensors, acoustic current meters, and depth loggers for marine research institutions worldwide.",
    "rationale": "The Cinder Shore palette — white page background, dark charcoal text, dark teal accent (#1e3a35), and burnt orange (#df5e12) — maps precisely to a precision instrument brand: the teal evokes deep ocean measurement environments, the orange marks calibration tolerances and critical values, and the editorial Playfair Display type scale signals exactitude over consumer accessibility. The generous spacing (×1.35 Lenclume scale) and 64px nav item spacing both communicate deliberate, unhurried precision."
  },
